{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16591","headline":"送陈偃赋得白鸟翔翠微 · 朱湾","name":"送陈偃赋得白鸟翔翠微","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不知鸥与鹤，天畔弄晴晖。\n背日分明见，临川相暎微。\n净中云一点，回处雪孤飞。\n正好南枝住，翩翩何所归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}